            "sid": "MAT 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hara atu airi ariphokala anauka, atu anjina amreha mutu yekala ni bwibwi, mana kala ana pepho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Jesu wamtuluza yuya pepho, naye yuya bwibwi achiandza kugomba. Atu anji aangalala, achiamba, “Dzambo dza hiri tahudzangbweriona kahi ya tsi ya Iziraeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
