                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi ariphoona go makundi ga atu, waaonera mbazi kpwa sababu kala ana wasiwasi na kala taamanya ahendedze, dza mangʼondzi gasigo na mrisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.36",
